(7739024, 1275937, 173844, '<td valign="top">With those horns it''s easy to be cocky.  Splendid peek into this world underfoot.  Congenial greens.  The eye looks like agate.  Nice clarity.  Subtle diagonals.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'With those horns it''s easy to be cocky.  Splendid peek into this world underfoot.  Congenial greens.  The eye looks like agate.  Nice clarity.  Subtle diagonals.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2023-02-23 22:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739025, 1276100, 173844, '<td valign="top">This feels like the end of a journey, the ladybird emerging from a tunnel, or a wormhole in space.  Sumptuous setting, with the ladybug having that hint of orange that invites the eye to linger.  It''s neat how the very shallow depth of field grazes the petal edges, left and right.</td>', 'This feels like the end of a journey, the ladybird emerging from a tunnel, or a wormhole in space.  Sumptuous setting, with the ladybug having that hint of orange that invites the eye to linger.  It''s neat how the very shallow depth of field grazes the petal edges, left and right.', '2023-02-23 22:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739026, 1276128, 173844, '<td valign="top">At first I thought this was a severely angled evergreen forest.  Then saw that it''s delicate ice grown on a cold window --  at least that''s what I think it is.  The jaunty angle makes this for me, and the subtly colored rings in the background.  Compelling image, easily beautiful.</td>', 'At first I thought this was a severely angled evergreen forest.  Then saw that it''s delicate ice grown on a cold window --  at least that''s what I think it is.  The jaunty angle makes this for me, and the subtly colored rings in the background.  Compelling image, easily beautiful.', '2023-02-23 23:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739028, 1275897, 173844, '<td valign="top">What nature offers!  This deepish macro displays the endless creativity of life, and it''s like the flower is posing for adoring fans.  The soft colors, textures and shapes bring on a smile and serenity.  Nicely shown.</td>', 'What nature offers!  This deepish macro displays the endless creativity of life, and it''s like the flower is posing for adoring fans.  The soft colors, textures and shapes bring on a smile and serenity.  Nicely shown.', '2023-02-23 23:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739029, 1276130, 173844, '<td valign="top">An alien landscape right here on one''s window.  The stripe of ice makes a lovely abstract, seemingly flowing, as water does, being in its genes.   Pleasing color combination of blues and ginger ale.  Windows can display beauty inside, outside, reflected and right on it.  Fun to look at.</td>', 'An alien landscape right here on one''s window.  The stripe of ice makes a lovely abstract, seemingly flowing, as water does, being in its genes.   Pleasing color combination of blues and ginger ale.  Windows can display beauty inside, outside, reflected and right on it.  Fun to look at.', '2023-02-23 23:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
